    "dek": "A great asset can be worth owning and still not be worth buying at this print. Full bench on whether waiting for substantially lower BTC \u2014 including a $46k deep node \u2014 is +EV with only today\u2019s packet, or the See\u2019s $25 million ceiling in reverse.",
    "cover": "images/cover-price-of-waiting.png",
