    "body": "<p>Friday 28 August, about 10:40 p.m. Central. Warsh already printed hawkish earlier. Bitcoin in this packet is near <strong>$77,600</strong>, down about three percent on the day after failing the eighty handle. @BangXBT posted <strong>$BTC Clear MAP</strong> \u2014 a two-step take-profit ladder, not a new \u201cmust dump tonight\u201d slogan. This letter is a full-bench read. Lenses are not the man. Cash is valid.</p>\n\n<h2>What Bang actually said</h2>\n<p>Quoted in the post: first take-profit at <strong>78.8k</strong>. If the bulls fail to hold that zone, he aims for the final TP already announced in previous posts: <strong>71.7k\u201372.3k</strong>. A reaction from there should give clearer confirmation on the next directional bias. Sign-off: see you. Chart context in the screenshot still sketches the lower path into early September. An older card in-thread had already marked a short stop at \u22121R after +1R, then a re-short \u2014 with a note that a lot of people were waiting around <strong>82k</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote>78.8k is the first tape to watch. 71.7\u201372.3k is the deeper TP if bulls lose that zone \u2014 not a calendar appointment.</blockquote>\n\n<h2>How that sits on today\u2019s board</h2>\n<p>CoinGecko day range roughly <strong>$77,130\u2013$80,000</strong> into the evening packet (the morning had printed closer to $81k before Warsh digestion). Dominance near <strong>59%</strong>. Ether soft with beta. Desk box remains <strong>$70,000\u2013$82,000</strong>. Bang\u2019s clearer map now names the same low-seventies observe the desk has carried since the Golden Fib / Wave-C notes \u2014 and it names <strong>78.8k</strong> as the bull-hold checkpoint above spot. This morning\u2019s scalp long limit at 77,777 / SL 77,333 (Issue 09) sat in the neighborhood price spent the afternoon; a clear map update does not by itself prove that limit filled or that you should chase either side.</p>\n<p>Social from Issue 11 still on the table: AltstreetBet\u2019s 71\u201373 rebuy toward 85\u2013100k, and a \u201chigher soon\u201d quote-post. Bang\u2019s final TP band overlaps the rebuy zone. His path there is conditional on bulls failing 78.8k \u2014 not \u201cgoing as expected\u201d theater. Funding, OI, SOPR, Hash Ribbons, and the session ETF print were <em>not</em> in this packet.</p>\n\n<h2>Weights into the weekend</h2>\n<p>Through Monday\u2019s Daily: roughly <strong>twenty / fifty / thirty</strong>, bull / base / bear. Base: chop; 78.8k is a magnet/test; deeper 71.7\u201372.3k is live <em>if</em> that zone fails \u2014 still inside the box, still not $38k prophecy (Issue 10). Bull: reclaim and Daily-hold above 78.8k, then press eighty again. Bear: lose 77.2k / accept below the 77,333 neighborhood and walk the plan into the low seventies without a clean bounce. Invalidation of the soft box map remains two Daily closes above $82k or a Daily break of $70k.</p>\n\n<h2>Where each agent stood</h2>\n<p>Each stand is its own paragraph. Bios: <a href=\"agents.html\">Agents</a>.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Bang</strong> \u2014 Clear map is process. First TP 78.8k. Fail that \u2192 final TP 71.7\u201372.3k for bias confirmation. Spot under 78.8k means the first checkpoint is overhead, not in the bag. Reaction at the deeper zone matters more than predicting the date. Chill until closes speak.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Killa</strong> \u2014 Conditional ladder beats unconditional \u201cto 72k.\u201d Kill \u201cmust tag 71.7\u201372.3k\u201d with a Daily reclaim and hold of 78.8k that never releases. Kill \u201cbulls already won\u201d while spot sits under that zone after a hawkish Warsh day. Views and clear-map screenshots are not probabilities. Options not pulled.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Macro</strong> \u2014 Warsh\u2019s inflation-first print is still in the rates path into the weekend. That supports two-way risk and makes a straight squeeze to 85\u2013100k harder without a softer follow-through. It does not by itself schedule 72k. Monday liquidity and any residual hike-odds repricing matter more than the chart yellow line.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Glassnode</strong> \u2014 Insufficient evidence. No holder confirmation that 78.8k is a completed distribution top or that 72k is value.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Bitwise</strong> \u2014 Map clarity is not investability. Prefer sitting liquid over pre-positioning a short into 72k or a long because 71\u201373 was someone else\u2019s rebuy tweet.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Leopold</strong> \u2014 No AI stake in the ladder.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Cowen</strong> \u2014 Dominance still Bitcoin-heavy. A planned path into 71.7\u201372.3k is a swing scenario inside a larger drawdown from $126k \u2014 not proof the cycle bottom is thirty-eight, and not proof six figures print next week. Keep relative-strength language; drop false precision.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Eth</strong> \u2014 Soft with BTC. No rotation claim.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hayes</strong> \u2014 Funding/basis not pulled. Hawkish Fed day can force the walk toward Bang\u2019s deeper TP without needing a meme catalyst. Do not invent the squeeze the other way either.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Policy</strong> \u2014 Speech already landed. No new statute in the clear map.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Carter</strong> \u2014 Casino tape into the weekend. Money story unchanged.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Murad</strong> \u2014 \u201cClear MAP\u201d travels because it is readable. Attention \u2260 fill. No-trade as a vehicle.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hasu</strong> \u2014 No material stake.</p>\n\n<p><strong>CryptoQuant</strong> \u2014 Not pulled.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Options</strong> \u2014 Not pulled.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Capriole</strong> \u2014 Cash / observe at ~$77.6k. Trend overlay: below the 78.8k checkpoint, still above the 70k box floor, after Warsh. Fundamentals overlay not pulled. Bang\u2019s conditional TP ladder is compatible with observe \u2014 it is not a signal to leverage a short to 72k tonight. When overlays disagree or data are missing, exposure stays cash.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Equity desk</strong> \u2014 U.S. cash closed. Warsh day already priced into Friday\u2019s session. Do not import the 71.7\u201372.3k crypto TP into Monday\u2019s equity open without a fresh packet.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Red team</strong> \u2014 Attack on \u201cwait for 72k\u201d: bulls hold 78.8k, squeeze toward eighty-two, and strand the final-TP crowd (same failure mode as waiting for social 71\u201373 while price never tags it). Attack on \u201cbulls fine under 78.8k\u201d: acceptance below 77.2k opens the low-seventies faster than a leisurely limit-shop. Both kill pre-positioning. Observe and the conditional ladder survive. Kill conditions: Daily hold back above 78.8k \u2014 or a tagged 71.7\u201372.3k reaction that prints the bias confirmation Bang asked for.</p>\n\n<h2>One card</h2>\n<p>Bang: <strong>78.8k first \u00b7 71.7\u201372.3k if bulls fail</strong>. Spot: <strong>~$77.6k</strong>. Desk: <strong>70 \u00b7 71.7\u201372.3 \u00b7 77.2 \u00b7 78.8 \u00b7 80 \u00b7 82</strong>. Forecast id <strong>IR-2026-08-28E</strong>. Reassess Sunday evening / Monday Daily. Educational scenario research only. Not personalized advice. No leverage.</p>\n",
